~ hail

pirate_captain: Nice station. Lot of soft places on it.
pirate_captain: Six hundred credits and we go and be somebody else's problem. Call it insurance. Against us.

- Pay the ransom [if station.credits_held() >= 600 /] [#blocked=You cannot raise 600 credits]
	$> station.credits(-600)
	$> story.shift_standing("pirates", 0.05)
	pirate_captain: Sensible. We will come back when you are richer.
	=> END
- Refuse them
	pirate_captain: Wrong answer.
	$> story.shift_standing("pirates", -0.1)
	$> station.raid(-1.0)
	=> END
